1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
San Marcos Kapitulo 10

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,420
Simungbat ni Jesus, babaen ti may samit asalutsod.

3
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:37,820
Anyang kaditi imbilin ni Moises kada kayo?

4
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,400
Insungbat da,

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:44,200
Inpalubos ni Moises amang isurat tilalaki ti pakakitaan,

6
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:47,320
iti panagsina sa napapanawin ti asawa na.

7
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:49,600
Kinunani Jesus kada kwada,

8
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:54,240
Insurat ni Moises na ito'y alintag na agbaay kada kayo,

9
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:57,260
gapo tanarigat kayo amakasursuro.

10
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,700
Ngayam idipunganay,

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,020
Idipinaraswa ti Diyos dito'y alubong,

12
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,720
na isa'o,

13
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:08,760
Inaramid ti Diyos ida alalaki ken babae,

14
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:11,440
kas kunatinasantuan asurat,

15
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:16,620
ket dito'y tigapuna apanawan to tilalaki dagitinagan na kenkwana,

16
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:19,780
ket makitipon to iti asawa na.

17
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:23,160
Agbalindan ton amay-maysa,

18
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,020
itikasta,

19
00:01:26,180 --> 00:01:27,200
saan dan adwa,

20
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:29,100
nudi dakit,

21
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:29,980
may-maysa,

22
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:30,660
sa abagi.

23
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:32,400
Ngarod,

24
00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:35,520
saan apagsinaan ti tao,

25
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,520
tipinagtipon ti Diyos?

26
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,800
Idinagsublida iti balay,

27
00:01:40,420 --> 00:01:43,560
pinalutput dagiti adalan kenkwana daytoy abanag.

28
00:01:44,220 --> 00:01:45,780
Kinunani Jesus kada kwada,

29
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:49,080
Tilalaki amangisina iti asawa na,

30
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:50,800
ket kalpasan na,

31
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,680
mangasawa iti sabali,

32
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:56,100
makabasol iti pannaki kamalala,

33
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:59,120
ama ikaniwas iti umuna nga asawa na.

34
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,500
Kastamit ti babae amangisina iti asawa na sa maki-asawa iti sabali,

35
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:09,180
makabasol iti pannaki kamalala.

36
00:02:09,780 --> 00:02:13,020
At datatawo anangyeg kadagiti ubbing kinesus,

37
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:16,100
tapno ipatay na kumati ima na kadakwada,

38
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,580
ngim pinaritan ida dagiti adalan.

39
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:22,000
Idimadlaw nesus ti inaramid dagiti adalan na,

40
00:02:22,340 --> 00:02:24,580
nakaunget ket kinunana kadakwada.

41
00:02:25,220 --> 00:02:28,000
Palubusan nyo dagiti ubbing nga umay kaniyak.

42
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:29,860
Diyo paritan ito,

43
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:30,180
kailangan ida,

44
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,360
tadagiti kas kadakwada,

45
00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:34,860
ti agtagikwa iti pagaryan ti Diyos.

46
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,980
Laglagi po nyo,

47
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:40,200
adinto makastrek iti pagaryan ti Diyos,

48
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:44,000
ti siya sino man adi umawat iti day tuy apagaryan,

49
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:47,740
akas iti panangawat iti maysa nga ubbing.

50
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:49,260
Kalpasan na,

51
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,420
sinaklot na dagiti ubbing,

52
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:54,700
kit impatay na ti ima na ititunggal maysa kadakwada,

53
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:56,540
sana binindisyonan ida.

54
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:59,500
Agro brobwat na Yesus apumanaw sa jay,

55
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:02,620
itiadamay sa alalaki ang nagtaray ang napankenkwana.

56
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:05,200
Nagpareintuming itisangwanan na,

57
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,740
kit sinalutsod na,

58
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:14,720
Kinunani Yesus,

59
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:17,640
Apay nga awagan nak iti naimbag?

60
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:20,400
Awan ti naimbag,

61
00:03:20,980 --> 00:03:22,240
nudilaeng ti Diyos.

62
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,120
Amum dagiti bilbilin.

63
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:27,980
Di ka mamapatay.

64
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:28,020
Di ka mamapatay.

65
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:30,680
Di ka makikamalala.

66
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:32,860
Di ka agtakaw.

67
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,880
Di ka agsaksi itiulbud.

68
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,180
Di ka agsuitik.

69
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:42,340
Agraam ka kadagitinagan nakken ka.

70
00:03:43,140 --> 00:03:43,680
Maestro,

71
00:03:44,540 --> 00:03:45,460
insong ba't itao?

72
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:50,300
Manipod kinaubing ko tinungtong pal ko amin dagitoy abilbilin.

73
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:54,900
Minatmatan ni Yesus asiaayat kit kinunana kenkwana.

74
00:03:54,900 --> 00:03:57,300
At damay sa apagkurangam.

75
00:03:58,020 --> 00:04:00,240
Inka ilako ti amin asanikwam.

76
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:03,660
Samu itad ti paglakwam kadagitinapanglaw.

77
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:07,080
Kit at danto kinabaknang mong sadilangit.

78
00:04:08,020 --> 00:04:08,880
Kalpasan na.

79
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:10,140
Umay ka.

80
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:11,840
Sumurot kanyak.

81
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:13,760
Idinang ngegna daytoy,

82
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:17,080
limiday tiro pati lalaki kit silaladingit

83
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:19,560
apimanaw agsipod tanabaknang unay.

84
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,160
Inwaras ni Yesus ti panagkita na,

85
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,700
sana kinuna kadagiti adalan na,

86
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,700
nagrigat kit din asumrak dagitinabaknan,

87
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:30,020
ng itipagariyan ti Diyos.

88
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:33,780
Nasdaw dagiti adalan gapo kadagitoy asauna,

89
00:04:33,780 --> 00:04:36,020
ngimintuloy ni Yesus tinagkuna,

90
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:38,020
Anak ko,

91
00:04:38,020 --> 00:04:42,020
anyan anagrigat ti sumrak itipagariyan ti Diyos.

92
00:04:42,020 --> 00:04:46,020
Nalaklaka ti ilulusot ti kamilyo itiabot ti dagum,

93
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:50,020
ngam ti isasarek ti baknang itipagariyan ti Diyos.

94
00:04:50,020 --> 00:04:53,020
At atdamanin ti si daw dagiti adalan,

95
00:04:53,020 --> 00:04:55,020
kit nagsisinaludsod da.

96
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:58,020
Siya sino nga rodan ti maisalakan?

97
00:04:58,020 --> 00:05:01,020
Minatmatan ni Yesus ida sana kinuna.

98
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:04,020
Saan amaaramid ti tao daytoy?

99
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:06,020
Ngim kabailan ti Diyos.

100
00:05:06,020 --> 00:05:11,020
Ta kabailan na ngaaramidan ti Diyos dagiti amin abambanag.

101
00:05:11,020 --> 00:05:13,020
Adtoy!

102
00:05:13,020 --> 00:05:15,020
Kinuna ni Pedro.

103
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:19,020
Binabayan mi amin kit si murot kamikin ka.

104
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:21,020
Kinuna ni Yesus kadakwada,

105
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:23,020
Pudno dayta.

106
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:25,020
Kit ibagak kada kayo?

107
00:05:25,020 --> 00:05:27,020
Siya sino man amang panaw itibalagan,

108
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:30,020
Weno kakabsat?

109
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:32,020
Weno nagannak?

110
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:34,020
Weno annak?

111
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:36,020
Weno dagdaga na kapukanyak?

112
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:39,020
Ken itinaimbag adamag?

113
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:42,020
Ad adon to ti awaten na ditoy abyag.

114
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:48,020
Awaten nan to ti nasursurokpay ngamginasgasot abalbalay.

115
00:05:48,020 --> 00:05:50,020
Kakabsat.

116
00:05:50,020 --> 00:05:52,020
Nagannak.

117
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:54,020
Annak ken dagdaga.

118
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:56,020
Agraman pannaka idadanes.

119
00:05:57,020 --> 00:06:00,220
Kit iti mapasungad apanawen,

120
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:04,220
Awaten nan to tibiyag ngaagnanayon.

121
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:09,020
ngayom, Ado dagiti umununa ita, amaud udi'nto.

122
00:06:09,020 --> 00:06:11,020
Kit. Ado dagiti maaud udi'ita,

123
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:17,020
ga umununa'n to.

124
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:26,080
Addan idi da Yesus ken dagiti adalan na, Itidalan asumang at ije

125
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:27,920
dagiti si Bubuting at at tao.

126
00:06:28,540 --> 00:06:29,720
Inyadayo manay Nesus

127
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,600
dagiti sa ngapulik at duwang adalan

128
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:34,180
sana sinarita dagiti mapasamak

129
00:06:34,180 --> 00:06:35,000
to kenkwana.

130
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,020
Kinunana,

131
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:39,800
Dengganyo, sumangat tayo

132
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,620
ija Jerusalem,

133
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,880
ket mayawad to sa jay ti anak ti tao

134
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:45,800
kadagiti panguluen apapadi

135
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,900
ken kadagiti mamaestro

136
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:48,720
itilintag.

137
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,880
Ikadeng danto ang mapapatay

138
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,900
sa danto yawat kadagiti

139
00:06:53,900 --> 00:06:55,620
hentil amangang angaw

140
00:06:55,620 --> 00:06:57,180
mang tup-tupra

141
00:06:57,180 --> 00:06:59,060
mang sapsaplit

142
00:06:59,060 --> 00:07:01,040
ken mang papatay kenkwana.

143
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,320
Ngamagongarto

144
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:04,900
kalpasan

145
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:06,240
ti talungal daw.

146
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:09,060
Ima sideg Nesus da Sanchago

147
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:11,020
kenwan nga anak ni Zebedyo

148
00:07:11,020 --> 00:07:12,240
ket kinunada.

149
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:15,300
Maestro, adakuma dawaten

150
00:07:15,300 --> 00:07:15,920
miken ka.

151
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:19,060
Anya ti kayat yung ipaay ko kada kayo.

152
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:21,060
Sinaludso'd Nesus,

153
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,160
Ipalubos mo kuma

154
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,860
ngayon tunagtugaw ka

155
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:26,580
ititronom ijay na dayag

156
00:07:26,580 --> 00:07:28,780
apagaryan, makitugaw

157
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:30,760
kamtukin ka, timaysa

158
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:33,140
itimakanawan mo, ket tisabali

159
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:34,580
itimakanigid mo.

160
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:36,160
Indawat da.

161
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:39,100
Diyo ammo tidaw dawaten nyo.

162
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:41,080
Imbagaan ni Jesus.

163
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:42,980
Kabaalan nyo kaditi

164
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:44,860
uminom iti kopa apaginuma?

165
00:07:45,660 --> 00:07:46,620
Kabaalan nyo aya

166
00:07:46,620 --> 00:07:49,080
itimabunyagan, akas itipan

167
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:49,880
nakabunyag ko.

168
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:52,400
Wen, kabailan mi!

169
00:07:53,140 --> 00:07:54,820
Insungbat da, tinunan

170
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:55,860
ni Jesus kadakwada.

171
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:58,720
Kabaalan nyo ti uminom iti kopa

172
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,840
apaginumak, ken mabunyagan

173
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,680
akas itipan nakabunyag ko.

174
00:08:03,660 --> 00:08:05,260
Ngayon awan ti karbangak

175
00:08:05,260 --> 00:08:06,000
abang pili.

176
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:09,480
Nusya sinunto ti agtugaw, itimakannawan ko.

177
00:08:10,060 --> 00:08:11,760
Wen no, itimakanigid ko.

178
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:13,640
Ti Diyos

179
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:15,060
timangted kadagitoy,

180
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:17,240
kadagiti nakaisaganaan na.

181
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:18,800
Nakapungtot

182
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,380
dagit isang apulong adalan

183
00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:21,880
kada Sanchago Ken Juan,

184
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:23,760
idinadamag dadaytoy.

185
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:25,940
Isot gapuna ngayayaban

186
00:08:25,940 --> 00:08:27,880
ni Jesus dagiti sangapuloket doa

187
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:29,140
kaya't kinunana.

188
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:31,940
Pagkaam mo nyo adagiti maibilang

189
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:33,600
ngaagturay kadagiti hentil,

190
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,920
adipinanda dagiti

191
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:36,800
iturayan da.

192
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:39,120
Kaya't dagiti pangulo da,

193
00:08:40,180 --> 00:08:41,580
adipinanda matdagitoy

194
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:42,220
ngaagturay.

195
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:45,860
Ngam saan kumaakasta ti aramidan nyo?

196
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:47,760
Ti agtarigagay

197
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,260
ngaagpangulo,

198
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:52,060
masapol ngaagsirbi

199
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:53,140
kada kayo amin.

200
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,640
Kaya't ti agtarigagay

201
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:57,000
nga iso ti kang runaan,

202
00:08:58,260 --> 00:08:59,540
masapol nga iso

203
00:08:59,540 --> 00:09:00,320
ti adipin nyo.

204
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:03,120
Tauray ti anak ti tao,

205
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,100
saan nga imay

206
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,140
apagsirbihan.

207
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:09,320
Nudiket, tapnoagsirbi

208
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,360
kanyawat natibiyag na

209
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:13,280
apangsubot kadagiti ado

210
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,060
atat tao.

211
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:17,320
Dimting ni Jesus

212
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,660
kendagiti adalan na,

213
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,060
agraman dagiti ado atat tao

214
00:09:21,060 --> 00:09:22,060
ijay hergo.

215
00:09:22,060 --> 00:09:24,220
Idi apumampanaw

216
00:09:24,220 --> 00:09:24,820
da sa jay,

217
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:27,860
adda nga agtugtugaw itiigid tidalan

218
00:09:27,860 --> 00:09:29,420
timaysang agpalpalama

219
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:31,400
ni Bartimio Abulsek

220
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,600
nga anak ni Timyo.

221
00:09:33,340 --> 00:09:35,440
Apaman ang nangignang adda ni Jesus

222
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,660
at aga Nazaret, impukaw na.

223
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:40,160
Jesus nga anak ni David,

224
00:09:40,700 --> 00:09:41,700
kasyan nakka di?

225
00:09:42,580 --> 00:09:44,000
Adu kadagit itataw

226
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,320
tinagungit kenkwana,

227
00:09:45,900 --> 00:09:47,440
kitimbagada nga agulimek,

228
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:50,160
ngiminyat adda na kitditi nangipukaw.

229
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:51,780
Anak ni David,

230
00:09:52,060 --> 00:09:53,380
kasyan nakka di?

231
00:09:54,380 --> 00:09:55,760
Nagsardeng ni Jesus,

232
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:57,780
ayaban niyo mandito'y.

233
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,080
Kinunana,

234
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:01,240
inayabanda nga rood ti Bulsek.

235
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,060
Agragsak ka!

236
00:10:03,820 --> 00:10:05,360
Kinunada kenkwana.

237
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,020
Tumakder ka,

238
00:10:07,740 --> 00:10:09,060
tapa ayayaban na ka.

239
00:10:09,900 --> 00:10:11,300
Inwarsin ni Bartimio

240
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:13,600
tika gayna, timakder adagos

241
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,320
ket imasideg ken ni Jesus.

242
00:10:16,140 --> 00:10:18,180
Anyo tika yat mga aramidagken ka?

243
00:10:18,980 --> 00:10:20,220
Sinalutsod ni Jesus,

244
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:21,660
Maestro,

245
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:23,660
makakita ako ma.

246
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,580
Insumbat ti Bulsek,

247
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:26,820
Inkan,

248
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:28,660
Kinunani Jesus,

249
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:31,480
Pinaimpagnaka ti Pamatim,

250
00:10:32,340 --> 00:10:34,060
Nakakita adagos ti Bulsek

251
00:10:34,060 --> 00:10:35,900
ket simurot kin ni Jesus.

252
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:37,900
Mababagandang

